### Login status subcommand

Source: https://github.com/openai/codex/blob/main/codex-rs/cli/src/main.rs

The codex login status subcommand checks and reports the current authentication state, printing the login method (API key, ChatGPT, access token, etc.) or "Not logged in" with exit code 1.

```rust
#[derive(Debug, clap::Subcommand)]
enum LoginSubcommand {
    /// Show login status.
    Status,
}
```

