### Enable TUI Logging for Codex (Bash)

Source: https://github.com/openai/codex/blob/main/docs/install.md

Configures the Codex TUI to write diagnostics to a specified log directory and tails the log file for real-time monitoring.

```bash
codex -c log_dir=./.codex-log
tail -F ./.codex-log/codex-tui.log
```

